The LZP compression algorithm implemented in s7fw/lzp.py was reverse engineered
black-box from a compressed firmware image by Jean-Baptiste Bedrune (@jibeee)
and presented at SSTIC 2015 and HITB Amsterdam 2015. s7fw is an independent
Python reimplementation of that algorithm.

